BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gail Daughtry and the Celebrity Sex Pass
DTSTART:20260710T020000Z
DTEND:20260710T035000Z
DTSTAMP:20260710T020000Z
UID:mbtNoZKbHu
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nMidwestern bride-to-be Gail Daugh
 try has a “free celebrity pass” agreement with her fiancé — who use
 s it. With her relationship in crisis\, Gail sets out on an epic journey t
 hrough Hollywood to even the scales.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-the
 aters/gail-daughtry-and-the-celebrity-sex-pass\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Invite
DTSTART:20260710T230000Z
DTEND:20260711T010500Z
DTSTAMP:20260710T230000Z
UID:VF3xhp3uQO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nJoe and Angela’s marriage is o
 n thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinn
 er party\, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited t
 he spark or lit the match that burns it all down?   ** Select Screenings 
 in 35mm! **Thursday\, June 9 at 7:30pmSaturday\, June 11 at 7:30pmSunday\,
  June 12 at 4:35pm\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-invite\n
 \nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
